      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 American Society for Bariatric Surgery. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The following position statement has been issued by the American Society for Metabolic and Bariatric Surgery in response to numerous inquiries made to the Society by patients, physicians, society members, hospitals, health insurance payors, the media, and others regarding the benefit of metabolic and bariatric surgery on long-term survival. An overview of the current available published peer-reviewed scientific evidence is presented."
